{"resourceIdentifier":"2085","resourceName":"Revegetation with fruit trees in North Manica Province, Mozambique","description":"The project “Revegetation with fruit trees in North Manica Province, Mozambique” foresees new plantations of fruit trees in the northern part of Manica Province, Mozambique, around 40 Km South-East from Chimoio town and just outside Sussundenga town. During the first phase of the project, during the years 2015-2018, totally 698.4 hectares have been planted with Macadamia (Macadamia integrifolia and Macadamia tetraphylla), Avocado (Persea Americana) and Litchi (Litchi chinensis). Later, new additional areas are foreseen to be planted and included in the project.The Project Proponent is Agrimoz S.a r.l. and the project is implemented Macs In Moz Ltda. Carbonsink Group S.r.l. is the consultation of this project.PUBLIC COMMENT PERIOD:This project was open for public comment from 04 February 2020 – 03 March 2020.","location":{"latitude":-19.370401,"longitude":33.248361},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2020-04-06","endExclusive":"2020-05-07","endInclusive":"2020-05-06"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2085"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"North Manica Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agrimoz S.a r.l."},{"type":"string","value":"NA, Luxembourg"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2085"},{"type":"bufferSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2085"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"30799"}]},{"code":"TOTAL_BUFFER_POOL_CREDITS","values":[{"type":"integer","value":3906}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBC